    "title": "ISMC Professor Chairs International Conference Session",
    "subtitle": "Dr Philip Wood chairs a session at the IMC in Leeds.",
    "summary": "Dr Philip Wood chaired a session on Change and Renewal in Non-Muslim Communal Outlooks in the Classical Islamic Period",
